   191                              <1> ; =====================================================================
   192                              <1> ; bu_mem -- ACDB, after each 64 KB block (AX = blocks counted, 1 first).
   193                              <1> ; Replaces AMI's "nnnnn KB OK" print. Keeps every register.
   194                              <1> ; =====================================================================
   195                              <1> bu_mem:
